{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QuantumObservableUniverses.QExtDeriv","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QuantumObservableUniverses.QExtDeriv","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.SubstrateParameter","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Field.Basic"],"declarations":2,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.qExtDeriv_classical","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.qExtDeriv_classical","kind":"theorem","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-ext-deriv.lean#L36-L40","doc":"The q-deformed exterior derivative recovers the classical `d` at `q = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.qExtDeriv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.qExtDeriv","kind":"def","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-ext-deriv.lean#L26-L34","doc":"**q-Deformed exterior derivative** (archimedean realisation):\n`d_q α = q⁻¹ dα + (1 − q⁻¹) θ ∧ L_ξ α`, evaluated at the substrate\npoint `q(p) = sp.field p`.\n\nLaTeX: `\\label{def:q-ext-deriv}` ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:ex:q-ext-deriv","label":"ex:q-ext-deriv","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-ext-deriv.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}